          <a href="#types" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. Ultralight, Rugged or High-Capacity</a>
          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. The 7 Best Camping Power Banks</a>
          <a href="#waterproof" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. IP Ratings Explained</a>
          <a href="#cold-weather" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. Cold-Weather Camping</a>
          <a href="#backpacking" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. Best for Backpacking</a>
          <a href="#solar" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Do You Need Solar?</a>
          <a href="#power-station" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">8. Power Bank or Power Station?</a>
          <a href="#flying" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">9. The 100Wh Airline Rule</a>
          <a href="#charging-at-camp" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">10. Charging at Camp</a>
          <a href="#care" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">11. Care Between Trips</a>
