          A camping power bank has to balance capacity, weight and weather. This guide explains mAh vs Wh, IP ratings, cold-weather performance and the airline rule, then ranks seven real banks. Wondering about solar? Our <a href="/best-solar-power-bank/">best solar power bank</a> guide covers panels and solar banks, and the section below explains when solar is worth it.
